Milestone 1 (Recreate ZAP environment with Vivado tools)
--------------------------------------------------------
1. Installing and Santity Checking
   a. Install Vivado (You may need to add Vivado path to .bashrc i.e. put "source /tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2024.2/settings64.sh" in 
      .bashrc)
   b. https://github.com/srvedulageth/solar_femtoTx.git
   c. cd solar_femtoTx
   d. make runsim TC=uart
   e. make syn 

2. Changing Address Ranges
   a. Change in zap_soc.v
   b. Change in src/tc/<testcase>/<testcase.s> and <testcase.h>
3. Instantiated EthMac from https://github.com/freecores/ethmac.git

